Mock `listNotifications`, `updateNotification` and `readAllNotifications` share one recipient/workspace/accessible-parent projection, also used by Bootstrap badges. Deleted or mismatched parents and private inaccessible projects contribute neither rows nor counts nor mutations; accessible archived history remains readable. Source Inbox excludes `update` from its unread badge, while Notifications counts every unread type. The list cursor records `(createdAt,id)` and filter/principal scope; changing an anchor's read state does not skip the next page. Read/read-all are idempotent persisted operations with server-clock timestamps and no undo history.

